      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Joy in the Trenches\nApril 14 on Netflix\n\n@netflix @NetflixIsAJoke @strongblacklead\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2041908929215787316",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-08T16:00:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When people are hurting, they look for answers.\n\nThe problem is\u2026\nsome answers are easier than the truth.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2041619773885444363",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-07T20:51:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "trevor-noah",
      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We celebrate who gets a seat at the table\u2026\nbut not enough people can afford the meal.\n\nEquality isn\u2019t just about who gets in.\nIt\u2019s about who can actually afford to stay.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/Trevornoah/status/2041248578061189374",
